# Keep images small and free of local secrets / build output.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
apps/api/storage
deploy/backups
# Local env files must never be baked into an image (apps/web/.env.local would
# hard-code localhost URLs into the web build). Production config comes from deploy/.env.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
